# RoamVantage — R2 panoramas

- Binding: `PANORAMAS` → bucket `roamvantage-panoramas` (`wrangler.jsonc`)
- Local bindings: `initOpenNextCloudflareForDev()` already in `next.config.ts`
- Access: `getCloudflareContext({ async: true }).env.PANORAMAS`
- Upload: `POST /api/uploads/panorama` (auth + ownership; JPEG/PNG/WebP; max 40MB)
  - Editor Save uses `persistScene=false` (R2 only), then `saveTourDraft` inserts/updates scenes
  - Legacy: omit flag / `persistScene=true` also inserts a scene row
- Object key: `tours/{tourId}/{uuid}-{filename}`
- `scenes.image_url`: `/api/media/...` path (segment-encoded)
- Serve: `GET /api/media/[...key]` — RLS on `scenes` gates draft vs public active (object must have a scene row)
- Editor drafts preview via `blob:` until Save; do not point the viewer at `/api/media` before the scene exists
- Compression: Sharp deferred (Workers-unfriendly); Cloudflare `IMAGES` reserved for later

Keep product logic here; do not push upload/auth into `@jeffgo10/panorama-viewer`.
